~ initialize_local_variables
do Variables.add_local("childhood", false)
do Variables.add_local("family", false)
do Variables.add_local("day", false)
do Variables.add_local("yday", false)
do Variables.add_local("dreams", 0)
do Variables.add_local("fingers", false)
do Variables.add_local("toes", false)
do Variables.add_local("breathe", false)
do Variables.add_local("eyes", false)
do Variables.add_local("questions", 0)
=> start

~ start
A feeble mind: You went to bed early tonight, feeling especially tired for no particular reason. Long day at work, perhaps?
A feeble mind: Staring at the ceiling, you didn't move an inch as hours passed you by. It's way past midnight, now. You're almost asleep, half-thinking, half-dreaming. 
A feeble mind: What about? => about

~ about
A feeble mind: ...
- My childhood. [if Variables.get_var("childhood") == false]
	A feeble mind: Memories forgotten, unwillingly unearthed.[do Variables.set_var("childhood", true)][do Variables.mod_var("dreams", 1)]
	A feeble mind: Buildings, larger than life. Planes, cars, buses, loud. Food you wouldn't eat. Leftovers?
	A feeble mind: A friend? Just not a very good one. Wouldn't ever let you play with their toys.
	A feeble mind: Were you poor? No. Not really. But it sure felt that way. 
	A feeble mind: Another friend. A dog. Gone too soon. 
	A feeble mind: Your parents loved you. They did all they could, but you resented them for it.
	A feeble mind: Eh, you can't blame yourself. You were young. Kids are pricks. 
	A feeble mind: For the first time in forever, you're able to push the guilt aside.
	A feeble mind: What else? => about
- My family. [if Variables.get_var("family") == false]
	A feeble mind: Mom. Dad. Two older brothers. A sister. Younger?[do Variables.set_var("family", true)][do Variables.mod_var("dreams", 1)]
	A feeble mind: Voices. Whispers. Screams. A handful of blurred faces and hushed voices. 
	A feeble mind: They call to you. It gets louder and quieter in equal measure. 
	A feeble mind: Shame on you, they say. Then they leave. 
	A feeble mind: Can you really not remember them? 
	A feeble mind: You've had this dream before, a few times. But these people mean nothing to you, now.
	A feeble mind: What else? => about
- The day it all began. [if Variables.get_var("day") == false]
	A feeble mind: The day all what began?[do Variables.set_var("day", true)][do Variables.mod_var("dreams", 1)]
	A feeble mind: Oh. Right. 
	A feeble mind: You vaguely remember crows filling up the sky. Could barely see anything anymore. Your parents thought it was an eclipse. 
	A feeble mind: Then they were gone. The sky turned red, a lot of people died, you survived. End of story. 
	A feeble mind: You were too young to understand what was happening. Or to remember much else. 
	A feeble mind: The Cullings, as people have fittingly named them, have been a thing ever since. 
	A feeble mind: You were placed in foster care, then left the day you turned eighteen. That's about it. Right?
	A feeble mind: What else? => about
- Yesterday. [if Variables.get_var("yday") == false]
	A feeble mind: The usual. Helped around any way you could. Got paid for it. Came home.[do Variables.set_var("yday", true)][do Variables.mod_var("dreams", 1)]
	A feeble mind: Watched some TV. A new tape your coworker gave you. Some old show from way back when, about a serial killer heartthrob. Complete non-sense. 
	A feeble mind: It was nice of her, though. She's always nice to you. Always greets you with a smile.  
	A feeble mind: Got through a couple of episodes, then went to bed. 
	A feeble mind: ...Or was that the day before?
	A feeble mind: Maybe it was a dream you had.
	A feeble mind: You try your hardest to remember. You can't. 
	A feeble mind: What else? => about
- Just... stop. Give in. [if Variables.get_var("dreams") >= 2]


~ dream
A feeble mind: It all feels rather... generic. Impersonal. These thoughts, or dreams, leave you cold and empty. No twitching muscles, no elevated heart-rate, no sweat.
A feeble mind: Are these bland memories really yours? 
A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]They're all brought to a stop by... something. A gust of wind you can barely feel. 
A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]You try to cling to them but they're... gone, somehow. 
A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]It's cold, all of a sudden. Colder than you've ever felt.
A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Are you awake now?
- Yes.
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]How can you be sure? => react
- No. 
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]That's right. You aren't. Wake up. => react 
- I... don't know?
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Time to find out. => react

~ react
A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]...
- Flex your fingers. [if Variables.get_var("fingers") == false]
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]You can't. [do Variables.set_var("fingers", true)][do Variables.mod_var("questions", 1)] => react
- Move your toes. [if Variables.get_var("toes") == false]
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Nothing happens. [do Variables.set_var("toes", true)][do Variables.mod_var("questions", 1)] => react
- Breathe. [if Variables.get_var("questions") >= 3]
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]You're not breathing anymore. 
	- Panic. 
		A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]You can't. => hours
	- Relax. 
		A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]You can't.
		- Panic. 
			A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Can't do that either. => hours
- Open your eyes. [if Variables.get_var("questions") >= 2 && Variables.get_var("eyes") == false]
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]The eyelids give way. Your eyes are open now. [do Variables.set_var("eyes", true)][do Variables.mod_var("questions", 1)]
	A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]It doesn't change a thing, however. Everything around you is shrouded in darkness, your vision as useless as it was when they were closed. 
	- Look around. 
		A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Your eyes move freely. Your head, however, is firmly stuck in place. Everything is darkness. 
		- Cry for help. 
			A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Your mouth can't open. Your vocal cords are a thing of the past. 
			A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Nobody could hear you, anyway. => react
		- Keep your mouth shut. 
			A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Finally, something you can do. => react
	- Cry for help. 
		A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Your mouth can't open. Your vocal cords are a thing of the past. 
		A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]Nobody could hear you, anyway. => react
	
~ hours
A feeble mind: [speed=0.2]...Minutes which might as well be hours pass. The cold is as numbing as the paralyzing fear. 
A feeble mind: [speed=0.6]All of a sudden, you hear a sound. [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_crow_goddess")]A caw. And then another. 
A feeble mind: The cold subsides. It is replaced by warmth and peacefulness.
A feeble mind: Your paralysis demon took their sweet time to show up. A... crow? 
A feeble mind: A one-eyed crow. It lands on your thigh. => hello

~ hello
Crow: It's so good to finally meet you, Keeper.
- Am I... dead?
	Crow: Not quite, my child. 
	Crow: Death shall have no dominion over you any longer. 
	Crow: You shall know happiness and power the likes of which feeble human minds can scarcely fathom. 
	Crow: You are, indeed, reborn. You are cleansed, and you are freed.
	Crow: But do not grieve your former self, for you are mine now, mind and flesh.
	- I...
		A feeble mind: You try to speak, but no words come out. 
		A feeble mind: Your thoughts trickle out of your head, one by one. Your mind is gone. => fear
	- Uh...
		A feeble mind: You try to speak, but no words come out. 
		A feeble mind: Your thoughts trickle out of your head, one by one. Your mind is gone. => fear
